# Buying spells from the healer (3012, 40), at the entrance to Mud School (3700), with only area_update running.
# Purser (10) is given 400 gold; Decimus (10) has none. Smokegod (60) blinds, poisons, curses and plagues Purser
# first, so the cures have something to cure, and drains his mana and moves.
# - heal with no healer here; the price list; a word that isn't a service
# - Decimus can't pay
# - every service by its words: light, serious, critical, heal, blind, disease, poison, uncurse, curse, mana,
#   energize, refresh and moves, each lagging Purser a violence pulse
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
@return
heal
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer purser 3700
transfer decimus 3700
set char purser gold 400
@mob 3012 3700
@as purse
heal
heal nonsense
@as dec
heal light
@as god
cast blindness purser
@pulse 24
cast poison purser
@pulse 24
cast curse purser
@pulse 24
cast plague purser
@pulse 24
@as purse
heal light
@pulse 12
heal serious
@pulse 12
heal critical
@pulse 12
heal heal
@pulse 12
heal blind
@pulse 12
heal disease
@pulse 12
heal poison
@pulse 12
heal uncurse
@pulse 12
@as god
cast curse purser
@pulse 24
@as purse
heal curse
@pulse 12
heal mana
@pulse 12
heal energize
@pulse 12
heal refresh
@pulse 12
heal moves
@pulse 12
@state
